# Grafana 管理員密碼(base64;不內嵌於任何 URL,故 + / = 字元無害)。
# grafana service 經 GF_SECURITY_ADMIN_PASSWORD__FILE=/run/secrets/grafana_admin_password 讀取。
# 跑 bash deploy/generate-secrets.sh 自動生成(leaf secret,不涉 dual-write)。
# 手動 fallback: docker run --rm alpine/openssl rand -base64 24 > deploy/secrets/grafana_admin_password.txt
change-me-grafana-admin-password
